# Three Tree Rootweaver ({1}{G}, 1/3): "{T}: Add one mana of any color." (CR 106.1a, 605.1a): the color is the player's choice and
# the mana is exactly that color. Turn 5 it makes {B} and only {B}: the pool holds that one mana, and the Bolt waits.
# Turn 7 it makes {R} and that alone pays for the Bolt, a color none of the deck's lands make: Bot2 20 -> 17, and it is tapped
# while both Forests are not.

